[0.028846, "o", "================================================\r\r\n  Weave CLI - Supabase Integration Demo\r\r\n  PostgreSQL + pgvector Backend\r\r\n================================================\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0;34mð Page 1: Supabase as Vector Database\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nWeave CLI supports multiple vector database backends:\r\r\n  • Weaviate Cloud\r\r\n  • Weaviate Local\r\r\n  • Supabase (PostgreSQL + pgvector) ⭐\r\r\n"]
[0.000026, "o", "  • Mock Database\r\r\n\r\r\nThis demo shows Supabase integration (EXPERIMENTAL)\r\r\n\r\r\nPress Enter to continue..."]
